California, Connecticut, Georgia, Maryland, Massachusetts, New York, Ohio, and Rhode Island primaries and the Minnesota caucuses. Dean, despite having withdrawn from the race two weeks earlier, won his home state of Vermont. Edwards finished only slightly behind Kerry in Georgia, but, failing to win a single state other than South Carolina, chose to withdraw from the presidential race. Sharpton followed suit a couple weeks later. Kuninch did not leave the race officially until July.\n\n/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/musique_4hop3__131775_29339_508306_70744__single-v12-1777645357/documents.txt:\n  Line 32: In March's Super Tuesday, Kerry won decisive victories in the California, Connecticut, Georgia, Maryland, Massachusetts, New York, Ohio, and Rhode Island primaries and the Minnesota caucuses. Dean, despite having withdrawn from the race two weeks earlier, won his home state of Vermont. Edwards finished only slightly behind Kerry in Georgia, but, failing to win a single state other than South Carolina, chose to withdraw from the presidential race. Sharpton followed suit a couple weeks later. Kuninch did not leave the race officially until July.\n\n/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/musique_4hop2__567956_14670_8987_8529__single-v12-1777645357/opencode_raw_output.jsonl:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1777646736996,\"sessionID\":\"ses_21bff7c7effey6tNkixYZNNqdK\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_de4008bdd001NUGHpgofrkvSfx\",\"messageID\":\"msg_de4008420001THF4Sp57N6Z4Zw\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_21bff7c7effey6tNkixYZNNqdK\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_8cabc788f64b41efb28f2402\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/.prompt_musique_4hop2__567956_14670_8987_8529_1777645357.txt\"},\"output\":\"<path>/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outpu