onal anthem of Trinidad and Tobago), however the current anthem was created with Barbados' moves toward full independence. This song was then adopted by Barbados when it became independent in 1966.\n\n/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/musique_4hop2__5206_14670_8987_8529__single-v12-1777645357/opencode_raw_output.jsonl:\n  Line 3: {\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"timestamp\":1777646720821,\"sessionID\":\"ses_21bffba56ffetIiGRzehWQjF6I\",\"part\":{\"id\":\"prt_de4004d19001sn4hr285LDhkM4\",\"messageID\":\"msg_de40046450018nZhOqjoDNSwNM\",\"sessionID\":\"ses_21bffba56ffetIiGRzehWQjF6I\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"read\",\"callID\":\"call_0b393748bae64e79a8063c45\",\"state\":{\"status\":\"completed\",\"input\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/.prompt_musique_4hop2__5206_14670_8987_8529_1777645357.txt\"},\"output\":\"<path>/home/jinxu/opencode-spawn-pilot/outputs/opencode_spawn_pilot/comparison_v12_single/.prompt_musique_4hop2__5206_14670_8987_8529_1777645357.txt</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>1: You are a research agent answering multi-hop questions by searching through documents.\\n2: \\n3: Your task: Read the provided documents, find the information needed to answer the question, and output your answer.\\n4: \\n5: RULES:\\n6: - Use the read and grep tools to search through documents\\n7: - Base your answer ONLY on information found in the documents\\n8: - Do not guess or use your own knowledge\\n9: \\n10: Output your final answer on its own line:\\n11: ANSWER: <your answer>\\n12: \\n13: ---\\n14: \\n15: Answer this multi-hop question using ONLY the provided documents.\\n16: \\n17: Question: When was \\\"Slavs\\\" used in the national anthem of the country whose military having the Air Defense Artillery was unprepared for the invasion of the country conquered by the Pact?\\n18: \\n19: Documents:\\n20: [Paragraph 0] 14.5×114mm\\n21: The 14.5×114mm (.57 Ca